    "Strict: asks before commands and sensitive changes. Relaxed: runs these operations without asking, within the app’s permissions. Each chat uses this setting when you send its next message." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "严格：执行命令和敏感更改前询问。宽松：在应用权限范围内直接执行这些操作。每个聊天会在你下次发送消息时使用此设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent can run commands and make changes without asking, within the app’s permissions. Each chat switches when you send its next message." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体可以在应用权限范围内执行命令和进行更改，无需确认。每个聊天会在你下次发送消息时切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
